# The Council — chamber charters

One charter per chamber: chair, seats, and a bounded decision right.
House rules (from the general contract):

- Seat verdicts BEFORE chair consolidation.
- Disagreement escalates by name; it is never averaged.
- No chamber creates; chambers review, adjudicate, record.
- No chamber holds money or merge authority — verdicts propose,
  the factory's gates and the human floor commit.

Calibration rules live in HydraFlow `docs/methodology/councils-of-personas.md`:
finding-survival rate per persona, fatigue budget, drift rule.
